{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated categorisation rules. Bump `version` on every edit: the version is part of the",
    "enrichment hash, so affected IPs get a new version marked 'enricher' instead of a silent change.",
    "Precedence (first match wins): special > internal > anonymizer > cloud ranges > domain_overrides",
    "(confirmed PTR) > asn_overrides > confirmed-PTR suffix rules > ASN type (PeeringDB) >",
    "org_keyword_rules (registry org, then AS name) > ptr_label_rules (any PTR) >",
    "unconfirmed-PTR suffix rules > company_suffix (registry org / AS name) > unknown.",
    "A confirmed PTR that matches a domain override or suffix rule beats an ASN override",
    "(e.g. googlebot.com inside Google's AS15169 is a search-engine crawler).",
    "Suffix patterns: '*' matches exactly one label; matched against the end of the PTR name.",
    "ASNs below were checked against RIPE's asn.txt on 2026-11-13."
  ],
  "version": 3,

